  <div class="heart-story-container">

    <!-- LEFT: FULL STORY TEXT -->

    <div class="heart-story-content">

      <h2 class="heart-story-title">
        More Than a Necklace.
        <span>A Little Piece of You. ♡</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="heart-story-description">

        <p>
          Some letters mean more than just a name.
        </p>

        <p>
          Maybe it's your own initial.
          Maybe it's someone you love.
          Or maybe it's a letter that reminds
          you of a moment you'll never forget.
        </p>

        <p>
          That's what makes our
          <strong>Dainty Heart Initial Necklace</strong>
          so special.
        </p>

        <p>
          A tiny heart paired with a meaningful
          letter — simple, delicate, and
          made to feel personal.
        </p>

        <p>
          It's the kind of little detail that
          makes an everyday outfit feel
          a bit more like <em>you</em>.
        </p>

        <p>
          Whether you're treating yourself
          or surprising someone special,
          it's a sweet way to keep what
          matters close to your heart.
        </p>

        <p>
          Choose your favorite initial from
          <strong>A–Z</strong>, available in
          <strong>Gold or Silver</strong>.
        </p>

        <p class="heart-story-final">
          Because sometimes, the smallest
